This software is an independent, unofficial reference implementation of
the mutual authentication protocol described in:

  A. Al-Rasheed, R. Khan, A. Ahmad, A. Saeed, F. Alturise, and S. Alkhalaf,
  "A Low-Cost Hybrid Elliptic Curve Cryptography Authentication Protocol
  for Trustworthy Internet of Things Communication," IEEE Transactions on
  Consumer Electronics, vol. 72, no. 2, pp. 4483-4491, May 2026.
  DOI: 10.1109/TCE.2026.3662053

A copy of the paper is included for reference at docs/base_paper.pdf
under fair-use/academic-reference terms; it is not covered by this
project's Apache-2.0 license and all rights remain with IEEE and the
original authors. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
